#%PAM-1.0
# The lock screen of SherlockOS (sherlockos-lock): the password of the session's user, checked
# as the console login checks it, like swaylock's service. pam_faillock, when login uses it,
# limits the tries. Installed in /etc/pam.d/ by the author: `just install-session` prints the
# command.
auth     include  login
account  include  login
